text:
The constraints force a unique schedule. Finn sits immediately after Hana, and Gus sits immediately after Ann, so those two pairs are locked blocks. Hana must be in slot 1 (slot 2 leaves no legal place for Elif), which puts Cara in 3. Ann–Gus then has to be 5–6, Dev 9, Elif 7, Ben 4, and Ivo 8. Swapping Ben and Cara breaks “Cara is scheduled before Ben.”

SCHEDULE: {"1":"Hana","2":"Finn","3":"Cara","4":"Ben","5":"Ann","6":"Gus","7":"Elif","8":"Ivo","9":"Dev"}
CONFIDENCE: 97
